AIMDL-hook guards for girder-jsonforms, against the `igsn` branch.

The functional half of this patch -- create_batch()'s relation_type,
inverse_relation_type and child_titles arguments, which Flyer Studio uses to
register each stack as a child of its foil -- was upstreamed as PR #34
("Allow custom relationships and titles in create_batch") and merged into
`igsn` on 2026-09-25 as 51500a3. It is no longer carried here, and the version
that landed is better: the new arguments are keyword-only, validated, and
covered by tests.

What remains are two guards that Flyer Studio needs in every deployment. It
runs inside Girder as the signed-in user, has no AIMD portal token, and never
talks to the AIMD portal -- but girder-jsonforms fires two AIMDL hooks on the
registration path regardless. Neither guard is upstream yet; both apply cleanly
to the `igsn` tip and both belong there rather than here.

  1. girder_jsonforms/__init__.py -- handle_deposition_registration() calls
     register_deposition_with_aimd.delay(), and .delay() needs a broker even
     though the task itself returns early when AIMD_PORTAL_TOKEN is unset. The
     guard moves that check ahead of the enqueue.

  2. girder_jsonforms/rest/aimdl.py -- propagate_to_projects() assumes every
     item belongs to the AIMDL collection. Items in a user's personal workspace
     cannot, so tagging one with an IGSN should not require an AIMDL
     deployment.

diff --git a/girder_jsonforms/__init__.py b/girder_jsonforms/__init__.py
index 13546ae..a08924d 100644
--- a/girder_jsonforms/__init__.py
+++ b/girder_jsonforms/__init__.py
@@ -398,6 +398,11 @@ def _item_advanced_search(self, query, limit, offset, sort):
 
 
 def handle_deposition_registration(event: events.Event) -> None:
+    # Local IGSN installations do not need a worker/broker for an unconfigured
+    # AIMD integration. The task itself also skips when this token is absent.
+    from .worker_plugin.amdee import aimd_portal_token
+    if not aimd_portal_token:
+        return
     ids = event.info.get("ids", [])
     if not ids:
         return
diff --git a/girder_jsonforms/rest/aimdl.py b/girder_jsonforms/rest/aimdl.py
index 01f98b3..18b5ec3 100644
--- a/girder_jsonforms/rest/aimdl.py
+++ b/girder_jsonforms/rest/aimdl.py
@@ -771,6 +771,10 @@ def item_save(event):
 
 
 def propagate_to_projects(item, sync=True):
+    # Personal workspace items cannot belong to the AIMDL collection. Avoid
+    # requiring an AIMDL deployment just to tag a user's files with an IGSN.
+    if item.get("baseParentType") != "collection" or str(item.get("baseParentId")) != str(_AIMDL_COLLECTION_ID):
+        return
     if not Setting().get(PluginSettings.PROJECTS_ENABLED):
         logger.debug("Projects are not enabled, skipping propagation")
         return
